      "content": "\"digital cleansing\" is exactly what it feels like. the thing is, when I contact support, the responses are always so canned, like they're following a script to avoid admitting anything is wrong. i even noticed that the metadata on some of my recent sent emails looks... off. like the headers were stripped or modified after I hit send. do you think this could be something higher up than just a standard bug? like an actual administrative override?",
